    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game Was Also Created to Hurt Certain People.</h2><br>Press Axe is part of a B-Game that I created to capture everything I like. I wanted to praise the games that were once popular and to reinterpret Bennett Foddy's philosophy in my own way. It's actually a game where you drag the mouse and throw the axe.<br><br>Why did I make this game? Time to get out of bed, modern classics that tickle your ears, piles of written code and cats, and even lovely rubber duck. I found out that a game was created that could harm people even though I just put my favorite things together. Take time to look back on your life by climbing objects that contain my wishlist to the fullest.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modern Classic Presented by Chris Zabriskie and Kevin MacLeod</h2><br>We've prepared a two-hour piano solo that's monotonous and entertains your interests and achievements. Once again, I would like to thank the two composers for making all this music available.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Throw a difficult double-edged axe to the top.<br></li><li> There are challenges ready to frustrate you.<br></li><li> Relax while listening to classical music during the game.<br></li><li> Constantly lose what you've accomplished.<br></li><li> Find the rubber duck hidden here and there on the map.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Stages and Various Functions Will Be Updated.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game Was Also Created to Hurt Certain People.</h2><br>Press Axe is part of a B-Game that I created to capture everything I like. I wanted to praise the games that were once popular and to reinterpret Bennett Foddy's philosophy in my own way. It's actually a game where you drag the mouse and throw the axe.<br><br>Why did I make this game? Time to get out of bed, modern classics that tickle your ears, piles of written code and cats, and even lovely rubber duck. I found out that a game was created that could harm people even though I just put my favorite things together. Take time to look back on your life by climbing objects that contain my wishlist to the fullest.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modern Classic Presented by Chris Zabriskie and Kevin MacLeod</h2><br>We've prepared a two-hour piano solo that's monotonous and entertains your interests and achievements. Once again, I would like to thank the two composers for making all this music available.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Throw a difficult double-edged axe to the top.<br></li><li> There are challenges ready to frustrate you.<br></li><li> Relax while listening to classical music during the game.<br></li><li> Constantly lose what you've accomplished.<br></li><li> Find the rubber duck hidden here and there on the map.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Stages and Various Functions Will Be Updated.</h2>",
    "short_description": "It's a game to find the legendary duck using a double-edged axe.",
